00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.520
There was a game called Five Nights at Treasure Island.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:23.000
It was one of the first Five Nights at Freddy's fan games that I ever played, if not, the first.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.660
