00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.920
But the developer said that this was his "last attempt at making a Five Nights at Treasure Island game"

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.200
and he wanted to finish it off strong.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.660
So, I thought it'd be kinda cool to play this game to see how far along, number one, the developer has come,

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:50.160
and to kinda reminisce about the time after FNAF and how that kinda changed a whole bunch of shit.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.780
